stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active
    active --> active: user activity refreshes TTL
    active --> expiring: 7-day TTL expires
    active --> waitingForJob: user leaves Session with active Job
    waitingForJob --> expiring: Job becomes terminal
    active --> expiring: user leaves idle Session
    expiring --> active: policy changed or work active
    expiring --> trash: maintenance tombstone
    trash --> active: user restores within 24 hours
    trash --> deleting: 24-hour grace expires
    deleting --> deleted: metadata removed
    deleted --> collected: no live blob references
    collected --> [*]
